# Input
```yaml
# should generate diagnostics
empty:
trailing_space: 
nested:
  child:
tagged: !!str
anchored: &anchor
tagged_and_anchored: !!null &other
flow: { a: , b }
flow_tagged: { a: !!str }
pair_in_sequence: [a: ]
? explicit_without_value
? explicit_with_colon
:
flow_explicit: { ? a }
"quoted":

```

